      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JADA HAYZE (6) is an accomplished sprinter with a great record at the short dashes. Last start was seventh over 457m at Q Lakeside in a Grade 4/5 (26.44) but sharper trip suits this time. Has never been out of the money in six starts this distance. Won at her only start from this draw. Has ability and is a key runner. SANDAVE STAPLES (2) hasn't been far away, finishing in the money twice in a row including last time in a Grade 4/5 at Q Lakeside over 390m. Expecting significant improvement this line-up. WALLOON ROCKET (5) comes off an average effort last start when eighth at Q Parklands over 520m behind Blazing Early (31.49) in a Grade 5. Better than last start and can bounce back. SPRING FOCUS (1) was in the money last start here at this trip - likely to feature again.",
